# Human-in-the-loop review for AI-assisted changes (docs/claude-guardrails.md §3).
# Enable "Require review from Code Owners" in branch protection for this to block merges.
# Replace the placeholder teams with real GitHub teams before enabling.

# Infrastructure-as-code and deployment config
*.tf                          @your-org/platform-engineering
*.tfvars                      @your-org/platform-engineering
*.hcl                         @your-org/platform-engineering
Dockerfile*                   @your-org/platform-engineering
**/k8s/                       @your-org/platform-engineering
**/helm/                      @your-org/platform-engineering
.github/workflows/            @your-org/platform-engineering @your-org/appsec

# Security-critical application code
**/auth/                      @your-org/appsec
**/security/                  @your-org/appsec
**/crypto/                    @your-org/appsec

# The AI guardrails themselves: loosening them needs AppSec sign-off
.claude/                      @your-org/appsec
.mcp.json                     @your-org/appsec
CLAUDE.md                     @your-org/appsec
.pre-commit-config.yaml       @your-org/appsec
config/claude-guardrails-policy.json  @your-org/appsec
scripts/claude_safeguard.py   @your-org/appsec
scripts/precommit/            @your-org/appsec
enterprise/                   @your-org/appsec @your-org/it-endpoint
docs/claude-guardrails.md     @your-org/appsec
.github/CODEOWNERS            @your-org/appsec
